[{"id":"ibtagha-16-14-16","words":["verb:ibtagha"],"options":[{"bs":"i da tražite","en":"and so that you (all) may seek"},{"bs":"traži","en":"he/it seeks"},{"bs":"i traži!","en":"and seek!"},{"bs":"zar traže?","en":"do they seek?"}],"ref":"16:14","answerWord":"وَلِتَبْتَغُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/dce0eb31377677e8b1e0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And He it is Who hath constrained the sea to be of service that ye eat fresh meat from thence, and bring forth from thence ornaments which ye wear. And thou seest the ships ploughing it that ye (mankind) may seek of His bounty and that haply ye may give thanks.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tražiti, težiti","en":"to seek, to desire"},"passage":["وَهُوَ","ٱلَّذِى","سَخَّرَ","ٱلْبَحْرَ","لِتَأْكُلُوا۟","مِنْهُ","لَحْمًا","طَرِيًّا","وَتَسْتَخْرِجُوا۟","مِنْهُ","حِلْيَةً","تَلْبَسُونَهَا","وَتَرَى","ٱلْفُلْكَ","مَوَاخِرَ","فِيهِ","وَلِتَبْتَغُوا۟","مِن","فَضْلِهِۦ","وَلَعَلَّكُمْ","تَشْكُرُونَ"],"marked":[16],"facts":{"verb":"ابْتَغَى"}},{"id":"ibtagha-2-198-4","words":["verb:ibtagha"],"options":[{"bs":"tražite","en":"you (all) seek"},{"bs":"tražimo","en":"we seek"},{"bs":"tražio si","en":"you sought"},{"bs":"pa tražite!","en":"so (you all) seek!"}],"ref":"2:198","answerWord":"تَبْتَغُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/ff94f055b66140e14916.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"It is no sin for you that ye seek the bounty of your Lord (by trading). But, when ye press on in the multitude from 'Arafat, remember Allah by the sacred monument. Remember Him as He hath guided you, although before ye were of those astray.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tražiti, težiti","en":"to seek, to desire"},"passage":["لَيْسَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","جُنَاحٌ","أَن","تَبْتَغُوا۟","فَضْلًا","مِّن","رَّبِّكُمْ","فَإِذَآ","أَفَضْتُم","مِّنْ","عَرَفَٰتٍ","فَٱذْكُرُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","عِندَ","ٱلْمَشْعَرِ","ٱلْحَرَامِ","وَٱذْكُرُوهُ","كَمَا","هَدَىٰكُمْ","وَإِن","كُنتُم","مِّن","قَبْلِهِۦ","لَمِنَ","ٱلضَّآلِّينَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"ابْتَغَى"}},{"id":"ibtagha-17-12-11","words":["verb:ibtagha"],"options":[{"bs":"da tražite","en":"so that you (all) may seek"},{"bs":"traži","en":"he/it seeks"},{"bs":"i traži!","en":"and seek!"},{"bs":"zar traže?","en":"do they seek?"}],"ref":"17:12","answerWord":"لِّتَبْتَغُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/d68d56248d6c9b1f9f13.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We appoint the night and the day two portents. Then We make dark the portent of the night, and We make the portent of the day sight-giving, that ye may seek bounty from your Lord, and that ye may know the computation of the years, and the reckoning; and everything have We expounded with a clear expounding.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tražiti, težiti","en":"to seek, to desire"},"passage":["وَجَعَلْنَا","ٱلَّيْلَ","وَٱلنَّهَارَ","ءَايَتَيْنِ","فَمَحَوْنَآ","ءَايَةَ","ٱلَّيْلِ","وَجَعَلْنَآ","ءَايَةَ","ٱلنَّهَارِ","مُبْصِرَةً","لِّتَبْتَغُوا۟","فَضْلًا","مِّن","رَّبِّكُمْ","وَلِتَعْلَمُوا۟","عَدَدَ","ٱلسِّنِينَ","وَٱلْحِسَابَ","وَكُلَّ","شَىْءٍ","فَصَّلْنَٰهُ","تَفْصِيلًا"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"ابْتَغَى"}},{"id":"ibtagha-17-66-7","words":["verb:ibtagha"],"options":[{"bs":"da tražite","en":"so that you (all) may seek"},{"bs":"zar traže?","en":"do they seek?"},{"bs":"traži","en":"he/it seeks"},{"bs":"i tražite!","en":"and (you all) seek!"}],"ref":"17:66","answerWord":"لِتَبْتَغُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/2c67d4d5676ac903cf27.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(O mankind), your Lord is He Who driveth for you the ship upon the sea that ye may seek of His bounty. Lo! He was ever Merciful toward you.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tražiti, težiti","en":"to seek, to desire"},"passage":["رَّبُّكُمُ","ٱلَّذِى","يُزْجِى","لَكُمُ","ٱلْفُلْكَ","فِى","ٱلْبَحْرِ","لِتَبْتَغُوا۟","مِن","فَضْلِهِۦٓ","إِنَّهُۥ","كَانَ","بِكُمْ","رَحِيمًا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"ابْتَغَى"}},{"id":"ibtagha-17-110-18","words":["verb:ibtagha"],"options":[{"bs":"i traži!","en":"and seek!"},{"bs":"traže","en":"they seek"},{"bs":"tražite","en":"you (all) seek"},{"bs":"pa tražite!","en":"so (you all) seek!"}],"ref":"17:110","answerWord":"وَٱبْتَغِ","answerSound":"audio/86a168bf6b385c265d5d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say (unto mankind): Cry unto Allah, or cry unto the Beneficent, unto whichsoever ye cry (it is the same). His are the most beautiful names. And thou (Muhammad), be not loud-voiced in thy worship nor yet silent therein, but follow a way between.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tražiti, težiti","en":"to seek, to desire"},"passage":["قُلِ","ٱدْعُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","أَوِ","ٱدْعُوا۟","ٱلرَّحْمَٰنَ","أَيًّا","مَّا","تَدْعُوا۟","فَلَهُ","ٱلْأَسْمَآءُ","ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ","وَلَا","تَجْهَرْ","بِصَلَاتِكَ","وَلَا","تُخَافِتْ","بِهَا","وَٱبْتَغِ","بَيْنَ","ذَٰلِكَ","سَبِيلًا"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"ابْتَغَى"}},{"id":"ibtagha-23-7-1","words":["verb:ibtagha"],"options":[{"bs":"traži","en":"seeks"},{"bs":"traže","en":"they seek"},{"bs":"tražite","en":"you (all) seek"},{"bs":"pa tražite!","en":"so (you all) seek!"}],"ref":"23:7","answerWord":"ٱبْتَغَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/e6d18b5aec8ebfef759f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But whoso craveth beyond that, such are transgressors -","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tražiti, težiti","en":"to seek, to desire"},"passage":["فَمَنِ","ٱبْتَغَىٰ","وَرَآءَ","ذَٰلِكَ","فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","هُمُ","ٱلْعَادُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"ابْتَغَى"}},{"id":"ibtagha-3-85-1","words":["verb:ibtagha"],"options":[{"bs":"traži","en":"he/it seeks"},{"bs":"tražim","en":"I seek"},{"bs":"tražite","en":"you (all) seek"},{"bs":"tražio si","en":"you sought"}],"ref":"3:85","answerWord":"يَبْتَغِ","answerSound":"audio/8350067893dd3b79e9ec.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And whoso seeketh as religion other than the Surrender (to Allah) it will not be accepted from him, and he will be a loser in the Hereafter.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tražiti, težiti","en":"to seek, to desire"},"passage":["وَمَن","يَبْتَغِ","غَيْرَ","ٱلْإِسْلَٰمِ","دِينًا","فَلَن","يُقْبَلَ","مِنْهُ","وَهُوَ","فِى","ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","مِنَ","ٱلْخَٰسِرِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"ابْتَغَى"}},{"id":"ibtagha-4-139-7","words":["verb:ibtagha"],"options":[{"bs":"zar traže?","en":"do they seek?"},{"bs":"tražite","en":"you (all) seek"},{"bs":"tražim","en":"I seek"},{"bs":"pa tražite!","en":"so (you all) seek!"}],"ref":"4:139","answerWord":"أَيَبْتَغُونَ","answerSound":"audio/c42c9449ab61e5de472f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those who chose disbelievers for their friends instead of believers! Do they look for power at their hands? Lo! all power appertaineth to Allah.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tražiti, težiti","en":"to seek, to desire"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","يَتَّخِذُونَ","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ","أَوْلِيَآءَ","مِن","دُونِ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","أَيَبْتَغُونَ","عِندَهُمُ","ٱلْعِزَّةَ","فَإِنَّ","ٱلْعِزَّةَ","لِلَّهِ","جَمِيعًا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"ابْتَغَى"}},{"id":"ibtagha-5-35-5","words":["verb:ibtagha"],"options":[{"bs":"i tražite!","en":"and (you all) seek!"},{"bs":"i traži!","en":"and seek!"},{"bs":"traže","en":"they seek"},{"bs":"traži","en":"he/it seeks"}],"ref":"5:35","answerWord":"وَٱبْتَغُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/97f49b287178a2780bf1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! Be mindful of your duty to Allah, and seek the way of approach unto Him, and strive in His way in order that ye may succeed.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tražiti, težiti","en":"to seek, to desire"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","ٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَٱبْتَغُوٓا۟","إِلَيْهِ","ٱلْوَسِيلَةَ","وَجَٰهِدُوا۟","فِى","سَبِيلِهِۦ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تُفْلِحُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"ابْتَغَى"}},{"id":"ibtagha-6-114-2","words":["verb:ibtagha"],"options":[{"bs":"tražim","en":"I seek"},{"bs":"da tražite","en":"so that you (all) may seek"},{"bs":"traže","en":"they seek"},{"bs":"traži","en":"seeks"}],"ref":"6:114","answerWord":"أَبْتَغِى","answerSound":"audio/b3f73643b4329b774b2a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Shall I seek other than Allah for judge, when He it is Who hath revealed unto you (this) Scripture, fully explained? Those unto whom We gave the Scripture (aforetime) know that it is revealed from thy Lord in truth. So be not thou (O Muhammad) of the waverers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tražiti, težiti","en":"to seek, to desire"},"passage":["أَفَغَيْرَ","ٱللَّهِ","أَبْتَغِى","حَكَمًا","وَهُوَ","ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَنزَلَ","إِلَيْكُمُ","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","مُفَصَّلًا","وَٱلَّذِينَ","ءَاتَيْنَٰهُمُ","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","يَعْلَمُونَ","أَنَّهُۥ","مُنَزَّلٌ","مِّن","رَّبِّكَ","بِٱلْحَقِّ","فَلَا","تَكُونَنَّ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُمْتَرِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"ابْتَغَى"}},{"id":"ibtagha-9-48-1","words":["verb:ibtagha"],"options":[{"bs":"tražili su","en":"they sought"},{"bs":"i da tražite","en":"and so that you (all) may seek"},{"bs":"tražio si","en":"you sought"},{"bs":"tražim","en":"I seek"}],"ref":"9:48","answerWord":"ٱبْتَغَوُا۟","answerSound":"audio/abd36874f52b41fa263e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Aforetime they sought to cause sedition and raised difficulties for thee till the Truth came and the decree of Allah was made manifest, though they were loth.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tražiti, težiti","en":"to seek, to desire"},"passage":["لَقَدِ","ٱبْتَغَوُا۟","ٱلْفِتْنَةَ","مِن","قَبْلُ","وَقَلَّبُوا۟","لَكَ","ٱلْأُمُورَ","حَتَّىٰ","جَآءَ","ٱلْحَقُّ","وَظَهَرَ","أَمْرُ","ٱللَّهِ","وَهُمْ","كَٰرِهُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"ابْتَغَى"}},{"id":"ibtagha-28-55-13","words":["verb:ibtagha"],"options":[{"bs":"tražimo","en":"we seek"},{"bs":"zar traže?","en":"do they seek?"},{"bs":"i tražite!","en":"and (you all) seek!"},{"bs":"da tražite","en":"so that you (all) may seek"}],"ref":"28:55","answerWord":"نَبْتَغِى","answerSound":"audio/177ddd4c98ab758f0d3f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when they hear vanity they withdraw from it and say: Unto us our works and unto you your works. Peace be unto you! We desire not the ignorant.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tražiti, težiti","en":"to seek, to desire"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","سَمِعُوا۟","ٱللَّغْوَ","أَعْرَضُوا۟","عَنْهُ","وَقَالُوا۟","لَنَآ","أَعْمَٰلُنَا","وَلَكُمْ","أَعْمَٰلُكُمْ","سَلَٰمٌ","عَلَيْكُمْ","لَا","نَبْتَغِى","ٱلْجَٰهِلِينَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"ابْتَغَى"}},{"id":"ibtagha-29-17-18","words":["verb:ibtagha"],"options":[{"bs":"pa tražite!","en":"so (you all) seek!"},{"bs":"tražio si","en":"you sought"},{"bs":"da tražite","en":"so that you (all) may seek"},{"bs":"traži","en":"seeks"}],"ref":"29:17","answerWord":"فَٱبْتَغُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/370a3ef398033541d3ed.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Ye serve instead of Allah only idols, and ye only invent a lie. Lo! those whom ye serve instead of Allah own no provision for you. So seek your provision from Allah, and serve Him, and give thanks unto Him, (for) unto Him ye will be brought back.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tražiti, težiti","en":"to seek, to desire"},"passage":["إِنَّمَا","تَعْبُدُونَ","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","أَوْثَٰنًا","وَتَخْلُقُونَ","إِفْكًا","إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","تَعْبُدُونَ","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","لَا","يَمْلِكُونَ","لَكُمْ","رِزْقًا","فَٱبْتَغُوا۟","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","ٱلرِّزْقَ","وَٱعْبُدُوهُ","وَٱشْكُرُوا۟","لَهُۥٓ","إِلَيْهِ","تُرْجَعُونَ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"ابْتَغَى"}},{"id":"adraka-6-103-4","words":["verb:adraka"],"options":[{"bs":"On dokučuje","en":"He perceives"},{"bs":"stiže ga","en":"he/it overtakes him"},{"bs":"stiže vas","en":"he/it overtakes you (all)"},{"bs":"stigao ga je","en":"he/it overtook him"}],"ref":"6:103","answerWord":"يُدْرِكُ","answerSound":"audio/5d6cb8e741922739f4e8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Vision comprehendeth Him not, but He comprehendeth (all) vision. He is the Subtile, the Aware.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stići, dostići, dokučiti","en":"to overtake, to reach, to perceive"},"passage":["لَّا","تُدْرِكُهُ","ٱلْأَبْصَٰرُ","وَهُوَ","يُدْرِكُ","ٱلْأَبْصَٰرَ","وَهُوَ","ٱللَّطِيفُ","ٱلْخَبِيرُ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَدْرَكَ"}},{"id":"adraka-10-90-11","words":["verb:adraka"],"options":[{"bs":"stigao ga je","en":"he/it overtook him"},{"bs":"On dokučuje","en":"He perceives"},{"bs":"dokučuju Ga","en":"perceive Him"},{"bs":"stiže vas","en":"he/it overtakes you (all)"}],"ref":"10:90","answerWord":"أَدْرَكَهُ","answerSound":"audio/d304ff220ec1d3811dde.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We brought the Children of Israel across the sea, and Pharaoh with his hosts pursued them in rebellion and transgression, till, when the (fate of) drowning overtook him, he exclaimed: I believe that there is no Allah save Him in Whom the Children of Israel believe, and I am of those who surrender (unto Him).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stići, dostići, dokučiti","en":"to overtake, to reach, to perceive"},"passage":["وَجَٰوَزْنَا","بِبَنِىٓ","إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","ٱلْبَحْرَ","فَأَتْبَعَهُمْ","فِرْعَوْنُ","وَجُنُودُهُۥ","بَغْيًا","وَعَدْوًا","حَتَّىٰٓ","إِذَآ","أَدْرَكَهُ","ٱلْغَرَقُ","قَالَ","ءَامَنتُ","أَنَّهُۥ","لَآ","إِلَٰهَ","إِلَّا","ٱلَّذِىٓ","ءَامَنَتْ","بِهِۦ","بَنُوٓا۟","إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","وَأَنَا۠","مِنَ","ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"أَدْرَكَ"}}]